\section*{1. Certification Purpose}
The OGRI v2 Stress-Test Certification Criteria define the minimum
performance, resilience, cryptographic integrity, and state-transition
reliability required for a Sovereign Routing Kernel (SRK) and
Astrophysical Crypto Engine (ACE) to be validated under catastrophic
multi-vector disturbances.

\section*{2. Certification Domains}
Certification spans four domains:
\begin{itemize}
    \item Kernel Stability
    \item Astrophysical Constraint Response
    \item Cyber-Physical Security Integrity
    \item Resynchronization \& Recovery
\end{itemize}

